Read it before reusing code from this repository.

This is a decompilation project. Its source tree mixes four kinds of code with
four different legal characters, and a single root license file cannot honestly
describe all of them. `LICENSE` covers the first. The other three are set out
below.


1. What the CC0 waiver covers
-----------------------------

`LICENSE` is a CC0 1.0 Universal public-domain dedication made by the
